.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c, optimisation and frequencies of Na+(H2O)6, started from the xTB geometry of the step before. This calculation shows how the same arrangement (six waters in the first shell) looks at the DFT level, so that its energy can be compared with the xTB energy and with the other arrangements.
